construct: not yet in a maintainer's tree - CachyOS/linux-cachyos#826, whose author is sending it
to linux-media; carried at the person's request until it lands. ipu7_pci_remove() cleaned up the
MMU before removing the devices that still free DMA through it: isys_remove() then oopses in
find_iova() on the NULL mmu->dmap (unbinding the driver, and on Panther Lake laptops after the
camera's first use).

Subject: [PATCH] media: staging: ipu7: remove the bus devices before the MMU cleanup

---
--- a/drivers/staging/media/ipu7/ipu7.c
+++ b/drivers/staging/media/ipu7/ipu7.c
@@ -2637,11 +2637,11 @@
 	if (!IS_ERR_OR_NULL(isp->fw_code_region))
 		vfree(isp->fw_code_region);
 
+	ipu7_bus_del_devices(pdev);
+
 	ipu7_mmu_cleanup(isp->isys->mmu);
 	ipu7_mmu_cleanup(isp->psys->mmu);
 
-	ipu7_bus_del_devices(pdev);
-
 	pm_runtime_forbid(&pdev->dev);
 	pm_runtime_get_noresume(&pdev->dev);
 
